    "description": "Reply with a Markdown message (1 to 65536 bytes) in conversation_id, the conversation of a message you are answering. Without conversation_id it would go to this puppet's owner unprompted, which only the owner's digest channel session may do; elsewhere it is refused. Posts once even if the call is retried.",
